data-end=\"871\" data-start=\"238\">Ensure reliable performance and smooth operation of your <strong data-end=\"311\" data-start=\"295\">Stihl MS 261</strong> chainsaw with the <strong data-end=\"383\" data-start=\"330\">Stihl 11410802104 Fan Housing with Rewind Starter</strong>. This <strong data-end=\"422\" data-start=\"390\">genuine OEM replacement part</strong> is designed to provide essential protection for your engine while ensuring effortless starts every time. The fan housing plays a crucial role in maintaining proper airflow to the engine, preventing overheating, while the integrated rewind starter allows for quick, hassle-free starts. Built to withstand heavy-duty use, this durable part ensures that your <strong data-end=\"789\" data-start=\"779\">MS 261</strong> chainsaw performs at its best, whether you&rsquo;re felling trees or trimming branches.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"890\" data-start=\"873\"><strong data-end=\"890\" data-start=\"873\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1409\" data-start=\"891\">\r\n\t<li data-end=\"933\" data-start=\"891\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"933\" data-start=\"893\">OEM Stihl part number: <strong data-end=\"931\" data-start=\"916\">11410802104</strong></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1020\" data-start=\"934\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1020\" data-start=\"936\">Designed for the <strong data-end=\"969\" data-start=\"953\">Stihl MS 261</strong> range, including <strong data-end=\"999\" data-start=\"987\">MS 261 C</strong> and <strong data-end=\"1018\" data-start=\"1004\">MS 261 C-M</strong></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1103\" data-start=\"1021\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1103\" data-start=\"1023\">Combines fan housing and rewind starter in a single, high-performance assembly</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1174\" data-start=\"1104\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1174\" data-start=\"1106\">Provides optimal engine cooling, preventing overheating and damage</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1254\" data-start=\"1175\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1254\" data-start=\"1177\">Reliable rewind starter ensures quick and easy starts, even in cold weather</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1311\" data-start=\"1255\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1311\" data-start=\"1257\">Built for long-lasting durability and heavy-duty use</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1409\" data-start=\"1312\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1409\" data-start=\"1314\">Easy to install with a perfect fit for <strong data-end=\"1363\" data-start=\"1353\">MS 261</strong> models, restoring your chainsaw&rsquo;s performance</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1772\" data-start=\"1411\"><strong data-end=\"1446\" data-start=\"1411\">Why Choose Genuine Stihl Parts?</strong><br data-end=\"1449\" data-start=\"1446\" />\r\nBy using the <strong data-end=\"1515\" data-start=\"1462\">Stihl 11410802104 Fan Housing with Rewind Starter</strong>, you&rsquo;re ensuring the highest level of performance, longevity, and reliability for your <strong data-end=\"1613\" data-start=\"1603\">MS 261</strong> chainsaw. Genuine Stihl parts are engineered to precise specifications to maintain the efficiency of your equipment, reduce downtime, and extend its lifespan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1820\" data-start=\"1774\"><strong data-end=\"1818\" data-start=\"1774\">Compatible with the Stihl MS 261 Series below:</strong></p>\r\n</div></div></div></div><div class='compatmodels'><div class='compatmodels_head'>COMPATIBLE TOOL MODELS INCLUDE:</div><div class='compatmodels_list'><a href='/Stihl-MS-261-C-BM-Quick-Chain-Tensioner-M-Tronic-Gasoline-Chainsaw-Spare-Parts/P782619' class='compatmodel_link'>Stihl MS 261 C-BM Quick Chain Tensioner M-Tronic Gasoline Chainsaw Spare Parts</a> / <a href='/Stihl-MS-261-C-M-325-R-Chainsaw-Gasoline-Chainsaw-Spare-Parts/P782615' class='compatmodel_link'>Stihl MS 261 C-M .325&quot; R Chainsaw Gasoline Chainsaw Spare Parts</a> / <a href='/Stihl-MS-261-C-M-M-Tronic-Gasoline-Chainsaw-Spare-Parts/P782617' class='compatmodel_link'>Stihl MS 261 C-M M-Tronic Gasol